# S8 tolerance scan (reconstruction of the Perlmutter in.s8): fixed geometry, run 0, one tolerance per call.
# -var start lattice : the shipped deck's starting lattice with recip_probes 16 (the 2026-08-07 scan)
# -var start npt     : an equilibrated NPT snapshot (npt.data) with the production pin recip_self 0.37933
variable tol   index 1.0e-5
variable start index lattice
units metal
atom_style full
boundary p p p
if "${start} == lattice" then   "lattice sc 3.1"   "region box block 0 8 0 8 0 8"   "create_box 2 box"   "mass 1 15.9994"   "mass 2 1.008"   "molecule h2o spcfq.mol"   "create_atoms 0 box mol h2o 12345"   "set type 1 charge -0.85"   "set type 2 charge 0.425" else   "read_data npt.data"
read_data npt.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-0.0060478324 -0.0060478324 -0.0060478324) to (24.806048 24.806048 24.806048)
  1 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  1536 atoms
  reading velocities ...
  1536 velocities
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0       
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0       
